### TITLE III: CRIMES AND OFFENCES AGAINST THE ENVIRONMENT

[Law No. 2021-032/of 24 May 2021 on pollution and nuisances;

Law No. 2014-024/of 03 July 2014 prohibiting the production, importation and commercialization of non-biodegradable plastic bags in the Republic of Mali;

Law No. 10-028 of 12 July 2010 determining the principles of management of the resources of the national forest domain;

